#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:5
msgid "Messaging"
msgstr "消息传递"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:7
msgid ""
"This page describes how ANet nodes exchange messages: how a message is "
"packed into a sealed envelope, what the sender reveals to the hub, how "
"the sender learns that a message arrived, how long old messages can be "
"opened, and how long a node keeps task content. The tasks and messages "
"themselves are the A2A objects described in :ref:`topics-delegation`."
msgstr ""
"本页说明 ANet 节点如何交换消息：消息如何封装为密封信封、发送方向 Hub "
"披露什么、发送方如何得知消息已到达、旧消息在多长时间内仍可打开，以及节点保存任务内容多久。任务和消息本身是 :ref:`topics-"
"delegation` 中所述的 A2A 对象。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:20
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:22
msgid ""
"Two nodes exchange *messages* within a *task*. A message is a signed A2A "
"message: a goal, a follow-up, a status update, a result or a payment "
"authorization. The node that sends a task is its *requester*; the node "
"that works on it is its *provider*."
msgstr ""
"两个节点在一个\\ *任务*\\ 内交换\\ *消息*。消息是经过签名的 A2A "
"消息，可以是目标、后续提问、状态更新、结果或付款授权。发出任务的节点是其\\ *请求方*，处理该任务的节点是其\\ *提供方*。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:27
msgid "The commands that send messages are:"
msgstr "发送消息的命令如下："

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:35
msgid ""
"``anet delegate`` returns the task at once; it does not wait for the "
"provider. ``anet message`` adds a message to an existing task, and either"
" side can send one. The MCP tool ``send_message`` and the ``SendMessage``"
" operation of the local A2A interface do the same and report the same "
"sentences. The complete command syntax is in :ref:`reference-cli`."
msgstr ""
"``anet delegate`` 立即返回任务，不等待提供方。\\ ``anet message`` "
"向已有任务追加一条消息，任一方都可以发送。MCP 工具 ``send_message`` 与本地 A2A 接口的 ``SendMessage`` "
"操作作用相同，并报告相同的说明语句。完整的命令语法见 :ref:`reference-cli`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:41
msgid ""
"A message does not travel as a direct request. The sending node signs it,"
" encrypts it for the recipient and places it in an outbox. A delivery "
"engine hands the envelope to the recipient's hub, or directly to the "
"recipient if the two nodes have established a direct connection. The "
"recipient's node collects the envelope from its mailbox, verifies and "
"decrypts it, and confirms the result. This separation has three "
"consequences:"
msgstr ""
"消息并非作为直接请求传送。发送节点对其签名，为收件方加密，并放入发件箱。投递引擎将信封交给收件方的 "
"Hub；如果两个节点已建立直接连接，则直接交给收件方。收件方的节点从其信箱取走信封，验证并解密，然后确认结果。这种分离带来三点后果："

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:49
msgid ""
"The sender does not need the recipient to be online. A message waits at "
"the hub, for at most 14 days, until the recipient collects it."
msgstr "发送方不需要收件方在线。消息在 Hub 等待，最长 14 天，直至收件方取走。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:51
msgid ""
"A message that cannot be handed over is not lost. It stays in the outbox "
"and is retried until it is confirmed or expires."
msgstr "无法交出的消息不会丢失。它保留在发件箱中并重试，直至被确认或过期。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:53
msgid ""
"The hub is transport only. It sees the envelope, not its content (see "
":ref:`topics-hubs-transport`)."
msgstr "Hub 只负责传输。它看到信封，而看不到内容（参见 :ref:`topics-hubs-transport`）。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:59
msgid "Sealed envelopes"
msgstr "密封信封"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:61
msgid ""
"Every message is sealed before it leaves the node. A sealed envelope has "
"an outer part that the hub can read and an inner part that only the "
"recipient can open."
msgstr "每条消息在离开节点之前都会被密封。密封信封有 Hub 可读的外层和只有收件方能打开的内层。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:65
msgid "Outer part"
msgstr "外层"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:66
msgid ""
"The identifier of the recipient's encryption key that was used, and the "
"delivery credential, if one is used (see :ref:`topics-messaging-sealed`)."
" A one-shot envelope also carries an expiry time (see :ref:`topics-"
"messaging-oneshot`). The hub needs this much to decide whether to accept "
"the envelope and to which mailbox it belongs. The size of the envelope is"
" rounded up in steps, so that it reveals the length of the content less "
"exactly."
msgstr ""
"所用收件方加密密钥的标识，以及投递凭据（如使用，参见 :ref:`topics-messaging-"
"sealed`）。一次性信封还带有过期时间（参见 :ref:`topics-messaging-oneshot`）。Hub "
"需要这些信息来决定是否接受该信封，以及它属于哪个信箱。信封大小按档位向上取整，因此对内容长度的暴露较不精确。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:74
msgid "Inner part"
msgstr "内层"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:75
msgid ""
"The message, the signature of the sender under its current key, the "
"sender's KEL and its key state notice (see :ref:`topics-identity-"
"witness`), and possibly a delivery credential for the reply. The inner "
"part is encrypted for the recipient with HPKE."
msgstr ""
"消息、发送方以其当前密钥所作的签名、发送方的 KEL 及其密钥状态通知（参见 :ref:`topics-identity-"
"witness`），以及可能附带的用于回复的投递凭据。内层使用 HPKE 为收件方加密。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:80
msgid ""
"The recipient's node reads the inner part and runs a fixed sequence of "
"checks. It verifies the signature against the KEL, checks that the key "
"state notice matches the KEL and is not older than six hours, checks the "
"time and the expiry, checks that the message has not been received "
"before, and applies its inbound policy. A message that fails a check is "
"rejected; the sender learns the reason in a sentence of the reason table "
"(for example ``key_state``), not in the words of the recipient."
msgstr ""
"收件方节点读取内层，并执行一组固定顺序的检查：依据 KEL 验证签名；检查密钥状态通知与 KEL "
"一致且不早于六小时；检查时间和过期时间；检查该消息此前未被收到；应用其入站策略。未通过检查的消息被拒绝，发送方得到的原因是原因表中的一句说明语句（例如"
" ``key_state``），而不是收件方自己的措辞。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:88
msgid ""
"The envelope is bound to its task by a second, per-task key. The first "
"message of a task is encrypted only under the recipient's daily key. "
"Replies, results, previews and payment messages within the same task are "
"encrypted in two layers, the inner one under a key that exists only for "
"this task. The second layer is discarded when the task ends at the node "
"that holds it (see :ref:`topics-messaging-fs`)."
msgstr ""
"信封通过第二把、按任务区分的密钥绑定到其任务。任务的第一条消息仅用收件方的每日密钥加密。同一任务内的回复、结果、预览和付款消息采用两层加密，内层使用仅为该任务存在的密钥。第二层在任务于持有它的节点结束时丢弃（参见"
" :ref:`topics-messaging-fs`）。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:98
msgid "Sealed sender"
msgstr "封闭发送方"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:100
msgid ""
"A hub must be able to accept an envelope without knowing who sent it, and"
" at the same time must be able to refuse floods. ANet solves this with "
"*delivery credentials* issued by the recipient."
msgstr "Hub 必须能在不知道发送方是谁的情况下接受信封，同时又必须能够拒绝洪泛。ANet 通过由收件方签发的\\ *投递凭据*\\ 解决这一问题。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:105
msgid "First contact"
msgstr "首次联系"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:107
msgid ""
"The first message to a peer is a *first contact*. The sender's node opens"
" a short session with its own hub, signing the request with its identity."
" The hub authenticates the sender and counts the message against the "
"sender's limits. As a consequence the hub knows that this envelope is "
"from this sender. It does not keep that fact, and it holds no signature "
"of the sender that it could show to a third party."
msgstr ""
"向某个对端发送的第一条消息是\\ *首次联系*。发送方节点与自己的 Hub 开启一个短会话，用其身份对请求签名。Hub "
"对发送方进行身份认证，并将该消息计入发送方的限额。因此 Hub 知道这个信封来自这个发送方，但不保留这一事实，也没有可向第三方出示的发送方签名。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:115
msgid "Delivery credentials"
msgstr "投递凭据"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:117
msgid ""
"Inside every message, a node gives its peer a *delivery credential*: a "
"signed authorization to deliver to its mailbox. The hub accepts an "
"envelope that presents a valid credential without any statement about the"
" sender. The recipient signs the credential with a mailbox signing key "
"that is registered at the hub, and the credential contains no information"
" about the holder. The hub can group the envelopes that arrive under the "
"same credential, but it cannot tell who holds it."
msgstr ""
"节点在每条消息内部，向其对端提供一份\\ *投递凭据*：向其信箱投递的签名授权。Hub "
"接受出示有效凭据的信封，无需任何关于发送方的声明。收件方使用在 Hub 注册的信箱签名密钥对凭据签名，凭据不含任何关于持有者的信息。Hub "
"可以将持同一凭据到达的信封归为一组，但无法判断持有者是谁。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:125
msgid "There are two classes of credential."
msgstr "凭据分为两类。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:127
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "联系人"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:128
msgid ""
"Given to a peer that is on the recipient's allow or trust list. It stays "
"valid for 30 days and is renewed with later messages. Messages under it "
"are limited to 20 per second, with a burst of 200. A requester also gives"
" its provider a contact credential for the duration of one task (see "
"below)."
msgstr ""
"签发给收件方 allow 或 trust 名单中的对端。有效期 30 天，随后续消息续期。凭此发送的消息限速为每秒 20 条，突发 200 "
"条。请求方还会在一个任务期间向其提供方提供一份联系人凭据（见下文）。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:134
msgid "Non-contact"
msgstr "非联系人"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:135
msgid ""
"Given to any other peer. It stays valid for seven days. Messages under it"
" are limited to 1 per second, with a burst of 10, and count against the "
"recipient's separate share of the mailbox for non-contacts (see :ref"
":`topics-hubs-quota`)."
msgstr ""
"签发给其他任何对端。有效期七天。凭此发送的消息限速为每秒 1 条，突发 10 条，并计入收件方信箱中专为非联系人划出的份额（参见 :ref"
":`topics-hubs-quota`）。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:140
msgid ""
"Inside a task that may involve payment, a node issues only credentials "
"that are valid for that task, so that a settlement links the payer to "
"that interaction and no other. Such a one-task credential remains valid "
"for at most seven days. A peer on the deny list receives no credential."
msgstr ""
"在可能涉及付款的任务内，节点只签发仅对该任务有效的凭据，使结算只把付款方与该次交互关联，而不与其他交互关联。这种单任务凭据的有效期最长七天。deny"
" 名单中的对端不会获得凭据。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:145
msgid ""
"A credential is withdrawn automatically when the recipient takes the peer"
" off the list, when a message under it is abused, and after an emergency "
"rotation of the issuer (see :ref:`topics-identity`). The sender returns "
"to first contact for the next message. This happens without interrupting "
"a task and without action by the user. When the hub refuses a credential "
"without a reason the node can find, the message waits for up to ten "
"minutes before it goes as a first contact."
msgstr ""
"凭据在以下情形下自动撤回：收件方将该对端从名单中移除；凭此发送的消息被滥用；签发方进行了紧急轮换（参见 :ref:`topics-"
"identity`）。发送方的下一条消息回到首次联系的方式。这一过程不会中断任务，也无需用户操作。Hub "
"拒绝凭据而节点找不到原因时，消息最多等待十分钟，之后才按首次联系发出。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:153
msgid "A message goes as a first contact when:"
msgstr "消息在以下情形下按首次联系发出："

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:155
msgid ""
"it is the first message to this peer, or the peer has not given a "
"credential,"
msgstr "这是发给该对端的第一条消息，或该对端未提供凭据；"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:157
msgid "the credential has expired or been withdrawn,"
msgstr "凭据已过期或已被撤回；"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:158
msgid "the call may be paid, and no one-time credential exists for it."
msgstr "调用可能涉及付款，且没有为其准备的一次性凭据。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:160
msgid ""
"Otherwise the message goes under a credential and carries no sender "
"identity at the protocol level."
msgstr "除此之外，消息凭凭据发出，在协议层不携带发送方身份。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:164
msgid "What the user can see"
msgstr "用户可见的内容"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:166
msgid ""
"``anet peers list`` has a column, *sender identity*, that states for each"
" peer whether the next message carries the identity of the sender. It "
"contains one of three sentences:"
msgstr "``anet peers list`` 有一列\\ *发送方身份*，针对每个对端说明下一条消息是否携带发送方的身份。其取值为以下三句之一："

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:170
msgid ""
"``your messages carry no sender identity (the hub may still infer it from"
" network address and timing)``"
msgstr ""
"``your messages carry no sender identity (the hub may still infer it from"
" network address and timing)``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:171
msgid "A valid credential from this peer exists."
msgstr "存在来自该对端的有效凭据。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:173
msgid ""
"``the hub will know directly that your next message is from you (this "
"changes on its own once they reply)``"
msgstr ""
"``the hub will know directly that your next message is from you (this "
"changes on its own once they reply)``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:174
msgid "No credential exists. The next message is a first contact."
msgstr "不存在凭据，下一条消息是首次联系。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:176
msgid ""
"``they may charge: the hub will know directly that new tasks are from "
"you``"
msgstr ""
"``they may charge: the hub will know directly that new tasks are from "
"you``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:177
msgid ""
"A credential exists, but the peer's service may charge, so new tasks go "
"as first contacts."
msgstr "存在凭据，但对端的服务可能收费，因此新任务按首次联系发出。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:180
msgid ""
"The first sentence states a fact about the protocol. It does not claim "
"that the hub cannot work out the sender. A node normally sends and "
"collects mail from the same network address; a hub can compare address "
"and time. A hub that acts against its users can also pretend that a "
"credential is invalid and force a first contact. A node waits for ten "
"minutes before it reacts, and ``anet doctor`` reports repeated refusals "
"under ``sender_privacy.hub``. Contact with an agent that the hub operator"
" runs gives no protection, since the operator is the recipient."
msgstr ""
"第一句陈述的是协议层面的事实，并不声称 Hub 无法推断出发送方。节点通常从同一网络地址发送和收取邮件，Hub 可以比对地址和时间。违背用户利益的"
" Hub 还可以假称凭据无效，迫使其按首次联系发送。节点会等待十分钟后再作反应，``anet doctor`` 在 "
"``sender_privacy.hub`` 下报告反复出现的拒绝。与 Hub 运营人员所运行的 Agent "
"联系得不到保护，因为运营人员就是收件方。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:192
msgid "Delivery confirmation"
msgstr "送达确认"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:194
msgid ""
"A message counts as delivered only when the recipient's node says so. The"
" hub reporting that it holds an envelope is not a delivery. The recipient"
" proves the delivery with a *delivery confirmation*, which neither the "
"hub nor an intermediary can forge."
msgstr ""
"只有收件方的节点声明消息已送达，该消息才算送达。Hub 报告其持有某信封并不是送达。收件方通过\\ *送达确认*\\ 来证明送达，Hub "
"和中间方都无法伪造。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:200
msgid "Mechanism"
msgstr "机制"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:202
msgid ""
"When a node hands an envelope out, it keeps a secret that only the "
"recipient can derive from the envelope (an HPKE exported key). After the "
"recipient has reached a final decision about the message, whether it "
"processed or rejected it, it produces a short token from the same secret,"
" plus an encrypted note. The token travels back by one of two paths:"
msgstr ""
"节点交出信封时，保留一份只有收件方才能从信封导出的秘密（HPKE "
"导出密钥）。收件方对消息做出最终处理决定后，无论是已处理还是已拒绝，都会用同一秘密生成一个短令牌，外加一份加密的备注。令牌经两条路径之一送回："

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:208
msgid "On a direct connection, it returns in the reply to the sender."
msgstr "在直接连接上，令牌随回复返回给发送方。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:209
msgid ""
"Through a hub, the recipient's node gives it to the hub when it "
"acknowledges the envelope. The hub keeps it for seven days. The sender "
"queries it with a random identifier and a handle that only the two nodes "
"can compute (``POST /relay/status``). The request is anonymous: it "
"carries no identity headers. The hub answers ``queued``, ``done`` or "
"``unknown``."
msgstr ""
"经由 Hub 时，收件方的节点在确认信封时将令牌交给 Hub，Hub "
"保存七天。发送方用一个随机标识和一个只有两个节点才能算出的句柄进行查询（``POST "
"/relay/status``）。该请求是匿名的，不带身份标头。Hub 应答 ``queued``\\ 、\\ ``done`` 或 "
"``unknown``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:215
msgid ""
"The sender removes the message from the outbox when a valid token has "
"arrived. Until then the message stays and is handed out again if "
"necessary. An intermediary can hold back a message, but it cannot make "
"the sender believe that a message was delivered, and it cannot make the "
"sender believe that it was rejected. A refusal because of a quota or a "
"key state reaches the sender as a note inside the token, in a reason code"
" of the reason table."
msgstr "有效令牌到达后，发送方将消息从发件箱移除。在此之前，消息一直保留，必要时重新交出。中间方可以扣留消息，但无法让发送方相信消息已送达，也无法让发送方相信消息已被拒绝。因配额或密钥状态而产生的拒绝，以令牌内部备注的形式到达发送方，使用原因表中的原因码。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:223
msgid ""
"The delivery confirmation is not a receipt. A *receipt* is the signed "
"proof of work that a provider returns after a task. The term delivery "
"confirmation is used for the mechanism described here."
msgstr "送达确认不是回执。*回执*\\ 是提供方在任务结束后返回的、经过签名的工作证明。送达确认一词专指此处所述的机制。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:228
msgid "States"
msgstr "状态"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:230
msgid ""
"Each message sent by a node has a delivery state, which tasks and "
"messages report as ``anet.delivery`` in their local metadata. The value "
"is visible in ``anet task get``, in the MCP tools and on the local A2A "
"interface. It is never sent to the peer."
msgstr ""
"节点发出的每条消息都有送达状态，任务和消息在本地元数据中将其报告为 ``anet.delivery``\\ 。该值可在 ``anet task "
"get``\\ 、MCP 工具和本地 A2A 接口中看到，从不发送给对端。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:239
msgid "``anet.delivery``"
msgstr "``anet.delivery``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:240
msgid "Detail"
msgstr "详情"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:241 ../../topics/messaging.rst:294
msgid "Sentence"
msgstr "说明语句"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:242 ../../topics/messaging.rst:245
#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:249 ../../topics/messaging.rst:252
msgid "``pending``"
msgstr "``pending``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:243 ../../topics/messaging.rst:260
msgid "``not_sent``"
msgstr "``not_sent``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:244
msgid "Not sent yet: the hub cannot be reached; anet keeps trying."
msgstr "尚未发出：无法连接 Hub，anet 会继续尝试。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:246
msgid "``not_sent``, waiting for order"
msgstr "``not_sent``，等待顺序"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:247
msgid ""
"Not sent yet: it goes out on its own once the task's previous message is "
"confirmed."
msgstr "尚未发出：任务的前一条消息得到确认后将自动发出。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:250 ../../topics/messaging.rst:263
msgid "``sent``"
msgstr "``sent``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:251
msgid "Sent; waiting for the other side's node to confirm it."
msgstr "已发出，等待对方节点确认。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:253
msgid "``queued_at_hub``"
msgstr "``queued_at_hub``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:254
msgid "Waiting at the hub for the other side to pick it up (they may be offline)."
msgstr "在 Hub 等待对方取走（对方可能离线）。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:256
msgid "``confirmed``"
msgstr "``confirmed``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:258
msgid "Delivered: the other side's node confirmed it."
msgstr "已送达：对方节点已确认。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:259 ../../topics/messaging.rst:262
msgid "``unconfirmed``"
msgstr "``unconfirmed``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:261
msgid "Not sent: it never left this node."
msgstr "未发出：消息从未离开本节点。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:264
msgid "Not confirmed: anet stopped waiting, and it may still have arrived."
msgstr "未确认：anet 已停止等待，消息仍可能已经到达。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:266
msgid ""
"While a state is ``pending``, the sentence is followed by the time at "
"which the task fails if the message is still not delivered. The command "
"prints the state on its own line, with the label ``delivery``:"
msgstr ""
"状态为 ``pending`` 时，说明语句之后附有一个时间，若消息届时仍未送达，任务将在该时间失败。命令在单独一行输出该状态，标签为 "
"``delivery``："

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:278
msgid ""
"The state ``unconfirmed`` does not mean that the recipient did not "
"receive the message. It means that the sender stopped waiting. Only the "
"case ``not_sent`` excludes that the message reached the other side."
msgstr ""
"状态 ``unconfirmed`` 并不表示收件方没有收到消息，只表示发送方已停止等待。只有 ``not_sent`` "
"这种情形能够排除消息已到达对方。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:283
msgid "Waiting reasons"
msgstr "等待原因"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:285
msgid ""
"When the node cannot hand a message over for a reason that clears by "
"itself, the state stays ``pending`` and the reason appears as "
"``anet.delivery_wait``. The task does not change. The node tries again."
msgstr ""
"节点因可自行消除的原因而无法交出消息时，状态保持 ``pending``，原因以 ``anet.delivery_wait`` "
"出现。任务不发生变化，节点会再次尝试。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:293
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "原因"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:295
msgid "``rate_limited``, ``redelivery_limited``"
msgstr "``rate_limited``\\ 、\\ ``redelivery_limited``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:296
msgid ""
"Sending is too fast and the hub asked for a wait; anet retries on its "
"own."
msgstr "发送过快，Hub 要求等待；anet 会自行重试。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:298
msgid "``strangers_busy``"
msgstr "``strangers_busy``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:299
msgid ""
"The other side's inbox for senders who are not yet its contacts is full, "
"so this is queued; it goes out on its own once they collect their mail."
msgstr "对方用于尚未成为其联系人的发送方的收件箱已满，因此消息排队；对方取走邮件后将自动发出。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:302
msgid "``mailbox_full``"
msgstr "``mailbox_full``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:303
msgid ""
"The other side's mailbox is full, so this is queued; it goes out on its "
"own once they collect their mail."
msgstr "对方的信箱已满，因此消息排队；对方取走邮件后将自动发出。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:305
msgid "``home_unreachable``"
msgstr "``home_unreachable``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:306
msgid ""
"The other side's hub cannot be reached right now, so this is queued; anet"
" retries on its own."
msgstr "暂时无法连接对方的 Hub，因此消息排队；anet 会自行重试。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:308
msgid "``session_unavailable``"
msgstr "``session_unavailable``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:309
msgid ""
"This node's hub is not taking first contacts right now, so this is "
"queued; run anet status to see the hub's state."
msgstr "本方 Hub 目前不接受来自本节点的首次联系，因此消息排队；运行 anet status 查看 Hub 的状态。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:311
msgid "``credential_refused``"
msgstr "``credential_refused``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:312
msgid ""
"The hub refused the delivery credential the other side gave you, so this "
"is queued; if it is still refused after 10 minutes it goes on its own as "
"a first contact (and the hub then knows it is from you)."
msgstr "Hub 拒绝了对方提供的投递凭据，因此消息排队；若 10 分钟后仍被拒绝，则自动按首次联系发出（此时 Hub 会知道消息来自本节点）。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:315
msgid "``notice_stale``"
msgstr "``notice_stale``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:316
msgid ""
"This node's hub has not confirmed the current key yet, so this is "
"queued; it goes out on its own once it does (see the identity line of "
"anet status)."
msgstr "本方 Hub 尚未确认当前密钥，因此消息排队；确认后将自动发出（参见 anet status 的身份一行）。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:319
msgid "``rotation_pending``"
msgstr "``rotation_pending``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:320
msgid ""
"A key rotation is being published, so this is queued; it goes out on its "
"own once that is done."
msgstr "正在发布一次密钥轮换，因此消息排队；完成后将自动发出。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:325
msgid ""
"The last two reasons come from the identity state described in :ref"
":`topics-identity-states`."
msgstr "最后两个原因来自 :ref:`topics-identity-states` 所述的身份状态。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:329
msgid "Time limits"
msgstr "时间限制"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:331
msgid ""
"A message that is not confirmed expires after 14 days. Before that, the "
"following limits apply to a task that this node sent as requester:"
msgstr "未被确认的消息在 14 天后过期。在此之前，对于本节点作为请求方发出的任务，适用以下限制："

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:334
msgid "``no_response_after`` in ``config.json``"
msgstr "``config.json`` 中的 ``no_response_after``"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:335
msgid ""
"A Go duration such as ``\"15m\"``; the default is 15 minutes. A task "
"whose delegation has been handed out, but not confirmed within this time,"
" fails with ``delivery_unconfirmed`` and the node asks the provider to "
"cancel it. A task whose delegation was confirmed fails with "
"``no_response`` if the provider says nothing at all within this time "
"after the confirmation; an answer that arrives later is still recorded. "
"The value ``\"0\"`` turns both deadlines off: an unconfirmed delegation "
"is then resent until it expires after 14 days, and a confirmed task keeps"
" waiting."
msgstr ""
"Go 时长，例如 ``\"15m\"``，默认为 15 分钟。委派已交出、但在此时间内未获确认的任务，以 "
"``delivery_unconfirmed`` 失败，节点请求提供方取消该任务。委派已获确认的任务，如果提供方在确认后的这段时间内毫无回应，则以"
" ``no_response`` 失败；之后才到达的应答仍会被记录。取值 ``\"0\"`` 关闭这两个时限：未确认的委派将被重发，直至 14 "
"天后过期；已确认的任务则继续等待。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:344
msgid ""
"Set ``\"no_response_after\": \"0\"`` for long tasks or for providers that"
" are often offline."
msgstr "对于长时间运行的任务或经常离线的提供方，应设置 ``\"no_response_after\": \"0\"``\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:347
msgid ""
"``delivery_unconfirmed`` has four wordings, according to the last state: "
"still waiting at the hub, waiting for a stated reason, never confirmed "
"after the hub kept nothing or could not be reached, and not confirmed "
"after 14 days. In the last case the other side may still have received "
"the message, and the sentence advises to ask them before sending it "
"again. A follow-up message on a task waits until the delegation is "
"confirmed; a cancellation and a payment do not wait for it."
msgstr ""
"``delivery_unconfirmed`` 依据最后的状态有四种措辞：仍在 Hub 等待；因所述原因等待；Hub "
"未保留任何内容或无法连接，始终未获确认；以及 14 "
"天后仍未确认。在最后一种情形中，对方可能仍已收到消息，说明语句建议在重新发送之前先向对方询问。任务上的后续消息要等到委派得到确认之后才发出；取消和付款不需要等待。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:355
msgid ""
"A message whose bytes never left the node before it expired is reported "
"as ``undeliverable``: the other side never received it, and sending it "
"again is safe."
msgstr "消息在过期之前其字节始终未离开本节点的，报告为 ``undeliverable``：对方从未收到它，可以放心重新发送。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:362
msgid "Forward secrecy and local retention"
msgstr "前向保密与本地保存"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:364
msgid ""
"A node discards old keys, so that an envelope that has been processed "
"cannot be opened later, even with the data directory. The protection has "
"two layers and one setting."
msgstr "节点会丢弃旧密钥，因此已处理的信封此后即使持有数据目录也无法再打开。该保护有两层和一项设置。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:369
msgid "Encryption keys per day"
msgstr "每日加密密钥"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:371
msgid ""
"Each node uses a new encryption key for each UTC day. A node publishes "
"the keys for the coming 14 days in advance, so that senders can address "
"it even if it is offline for a period. The hub accepts an envelope for a "
"key only until one hour after the end of that key's day. The recipient "
"deletes the private key of a day about 1 hour 15 minutes after the day "
"has ended, once it has read everything its mailbox accepted before that, "
"and its clock was checked against the hub's a moment ago. Otherwise it "
"deletes the key at the latest 15 days after the day ended. If the hub "
"does not allow its clock to be checked, the node uses its own clock after"
" one day of running time."
msgstr ""
"每个节点每个 UTC 日使用一把新的加密密钥。节点提前发布未来 14 天的密钥，使发送方即使在节点离线一段时间时也能向其发送。Hub "
"仅在某把密钥所属日结束后一小时内接受以该密钥加密的信封。收件方在该日结束约 1 小时 15 "
"分钟后删除当日私钥，条件是此前其信箱接受的内容都已读取完毕，且刚刚对照 Hub 校对过时钟。否则最迟在该日结束 15 天后删除。如果 Hub "
"不允许校对时钟，节点在运行一天后改用自己的时钟。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:381
msgid ""
"For a first message that has been processed, the consequence is: if the "
"hub behaves as intended, the ciphertext can usually be opened for about "
"one day after it was sent, and at most for 25 hours and 20 minutes. If "
"the hub withholds mail, reports false times or does not answer, the bound"
" is about 17 days, and no hub can make it longer. The statements assume "
"that the clock of the node is accurate, and one day is counted in running"
" time."
msgstr ""
"对于已处理的首条消息，其后果是：如果 Hub 按预期行为，密文通常在发送后约一天内可以打开，最长 25 小时 20 分钟。如果 Hub "
"扣留邮件、报告虚假时间或不应答，上限约为 17 天，任何 Hub 都无法使其更长。这些陈述假定节点的时钟准确，且一天按运行时间计算。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:389
msgid "Keys per task"
msgstr "每任务密钥"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:391
msgid ""
"Replies, results, previews and payment messages are also encrypted under "
"a key that exists only for the task. The node deletes the key when the "
"task ends at its side. After that the ciphertext of those messages cannot"
" be opened, for example, once a requester has received the result, the "
"ciphertext of the result is unreadable."
msgstr "回复、结果、预览和付款消息还使用仅为该任务存在的密钥加密。任务在节点一侧结束时，节点删除该密钥。此后这些消息的密文无法再打开，例如请求方收到结果后，结果的密文即不可读。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:398
msgid "Local retention"
msgstr "本地保存"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:400
msgid ""
"The plain content of a task that a node keeps is stored encrypted, with a"
" data key that is deleted at the end of the retention period."
msgstr "节点保存的任务明文内容经过加密存储，数据密钥在保存期结束时删除。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:407
msgid "Kind of task"
msgstr "任务类型"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:408
msgid "Retention"
msgstr "保存期"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:409
msgid "Configurable"
msgstr "可配置"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:410
msgid ""
"Non-public tasks (those the node sent, and those from peers it trusts or "
"approved)"
msgstr "非公开任务（本节点发出的任务，以及来自其信任或已批准的对端的任务）"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:412
msgid "30 days after the end"
msgstr "结束后 30 天"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:413
msgid "yes"
msgstr "是"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:414
msgid ""
"Public calls (calls of the node's public capabilities, and tasks from "
"untrusted peers under the open policy)"
msgstr "公开调用（对本节点公开能力的调用，以及 open 策略下来自未受信任对端的任务）"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:416
msgid "7 days, or the setting if it is shorter"
msgstr "7 天，若设置值更短则取设置值"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:417
msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:419
msgid ""
"The retention is the key ``content_retention`` in ``config.json``, "
"written as ``\"<N>d\"`` with N from 1 to 3650, or ``\"forever\"``. A "
"fresh ``config.json`` contains ``\"30d\"``, as does a configuration "
"without the key. The daemon refuses to start when the value is neither of"
" these and reports ``retention_invalid``."
msgstr ""
"保存期是 ``config.json`` 中的键 ``content_retention``，写作 ``\"<N>d\"``\\ （N 为 1 到"
" 3650）或 ``\"forever\"``\\ 。全新的 ``config.json`` 含有 "
"``\"30d\"``，缺少该键的配置也按此处理。取值不属于这两种形式时，守护进程拒绝启动并报告 ``retention_invalid``\\ "
"。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:425
msgid ""
"``anet retention`` shows the setting, and ``anet retention set`` changes "
"it:"
msgstr "``anet retention`` 显示该设置，``anet retention set`` 修改该设置："

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:441
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``anet retention --json`` prints ``{\"content_retention\": \"30d\", "
"\"public_retention\": \"7d\"}``. The change must be made from a terminal,"
" because a shorter period deletes content and a longer period keeps more "
"of it, and neither is for an agent to decide. When the change deletes "
"tasks, the command states how many and requires the answer ``yes``. With "
"the daemon running, the change takes effect at once and is recorded in "
"the evidence chain as ``anet.retention.changed``. With the daemon "
"stopped, the command writes ``config.json``, and the daemon reads the "
"value at its next start. A change made by editing ``config.json`` takes "
"effect at the next start, without a confirmation and without evidence."
msgstr ""
"``anet retention --json`` 输出 ``{\"content_retention\": \"30d\", "
"\"public_retention\": \"7d\"}``\\ "
"。修改必须在终端中进行，因为缩短保存期会删除内容，延长则保留更多内容，二者都不应由 Agent "
"决定。修改会删除任务时，命令说明将删除的数量，并要求回答 ``yes``\\ 。守护进程运行时，修改立即生效，并在证据链中记录为 "
"``anet.retention.changed``\\ 。守护进程停止时，命令写入 "
"``config.json``，守护进程在下次启动时读取该值。通过编辑 ``config.json`` "
"所作的修改在下次启动时生效，没有确认，也没有证据记录。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:452
msgid ""
"A task that has ended shows its retention as a line ``kept``: ``Content "
"kept until <time> (retention <period>).`` A task that no longer exists "
"locally is reported as ``no_local_task``; the sentence points to the "
"retention period and to ``anet audit --interaction <id>``, which shows "
"what the evidence chain kept. The evidence chain keeps the peer, the "
"time, the content identifier and the amount permanently, but not the "
"content."
msgstr ""
"已结束的任务以 ``kept`` 一行显示其保存期：``Content kept until <time> (retention "
"<period>).`` 本地已不存在的任务报告为 ``no_local_task``；说明语句指向保存期和 ``anet audit "
"--interaction <id>``，后者显示证据链所保留的内容。证据链永久保留对端、时间、内容标识和金额，但不保留内容。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:462
msgid "Clock check and local state"
msgstr "时钟校对与本地状态"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:464
msgid ""
"Early deletion needs a trustworthy clock. If the node's clock differs "
"from the hub's by more than five minutes, or cannot be checked, early "
"deletion is paused, and ``anet status`` and ``anet doctor`` say so "
"(``clock.skewed``, ``clock.unverified``). Deletions that have a fixed "
"limit are postponed by at most one day of running time and then follow "
"the local clock."
msgstr ""
"提前删除需要可信的时钟。如果节点时钟与 Hub 相差超过五分钟，或无法校对，提前删除即暂停，``anet status`` 和 ``anet "
"doctor`` 会给出提示（``clock.skewed``\\ 、\\ "
"``clock.unverified``）。有固定期限的删除最多推迟一天的运行时间，之后依本地时钟执行。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:470
msgid ""
"A node also detects that its data went back to an older state, for "
"example by a restored backup. It ends the tasks in progress with the "
"reason ``local_state_lost`` and generates new keys. If this happens twice"
" within seven days, another copy of the identity is running somewhere "
"else, and ``anet doctor`` reports a failure that recommends ``anet "
"identity rotate --emergency``. See :ref:`topics-identity`."
msgstr ""
"节点还能检测到其数据回退到较旧的状态，例如恢复了备份。此时它以原因 ``local_state_lost`` "
"结束进行中的任务，并生成新的密钥。如果在七天内发生两次，说明身份的另一份副本正在别处运行，``anet doctor`` "
"会报告一项失败，并建议执行 ``anet identity rotate --emergency``\\ 。参见 :ref:`topics-"
"identity`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:478
msgid "Limits of forward secrecy"
msgstr "前向保密的局限"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:480
msgid ""
"Plain content on the node can be read during the retention period. With "
"``forever`` it can be read for as long as the data directory exists."
msgstr "节点上的明文内容在保存期内可被读取。使用 ``forever`` 时，只要数据目录存在就可以读取。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:482
msgid ""
"Deletion depends on the file system. Snapshots on copy-on-write file "
"systems (btrfs, zfs, APFS), backups, and remains on SSD blocks are not "
"covered. ``anet doctor`` points to copy-on-write file systems."
msgstr ""
"删除取决于文件系统。写时复制文件系统（btrfs、zfs、APFS）上的快照、备份以及 SSD 块上的残留不在保护范围之内。\\ ``anet "
"doctor`` 会提示写时复制文件系统。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:485
msgid ""
"Records that the local coding agent, an A2A client, or ``anet pull`` "
"keeps are outside the deletion that ANet performs."
msgstr "本地编码 Agent、A2A 客户端或 ``anet pull`` 所保存的记录，不在 ANet 执行的删除范围之内。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:487
msgid ""
"After the theft of a data directory the thief also holds the secret "
"encryption keys of the next 14 days. An emergency rotation stops the hub "
"from accepting envelopes for the old keys at once; direct connections can"
" still use them until the peer refreshes the key set, which takes up to "
"24 hours."
msgstr ""
"数据目录被盗后，窃取者也持有此后 14 天的加密私钥。紧急轮换会使 Hub "
"立即停止接受以旧密钥加密的信封；直接连接仍可使用旧密钥，直至对端刷新密钥集，这最长需要 24 小时。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:492
msgid ""
"Payment authorizations are handed to the hub completely at settlement and"
" are not covered."
msgstr "付款授权在结算时完整交给 Hub，不在保护范围之内。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:494
msgid ""
"Both layers use X25519. An attacker who records ciphertext today and has "
"a quantum computer in the future is not covered."
msgstr "两层均使用 X25519。对于今天记录密文、将来拥有量子计算机的攻击者，则不在保护范围之内。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:500
msgid "One-shot sends"
msgstr "一次性发送"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:502
msgid ""
"Three kinds of envelope are not part of the outbox: preview frames, "
"requests for an extended Agent Card and the answers to them. They are "
"*one-shot* envelopes. A one-shot envelope carries an expiry time in its "
"outer part; the hub discards it when it has expired. The node:"
msgstr ""
"有三类信封不属于发件箱：预览帧、对扩展 Agent 卡片的请求以及对它们的应答。它们是\\ *一次性*\\ "
"信封。一次性信封在外层带有过期时间，过期后 Hub 将其丢弃。节点："

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:507
msgid "hands it out once, directly if possible, otherwise through the hub,"
msgstr "仅交出一次，条件允许时直接交出，否则经由 Hub，"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:508
msgid "does not queue it and does not resend it,"
msgstr "不排队，不重发，"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:509
msgid ""
"does not keep a secret for a confirmation, and the recipient does not "
"produce a token for it,"
msgstr "不为确认保留秘密，收件方也不为其生成令牌，"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:511
msgid "counts a failure and drops the frame."
msgstr "统计失败并丢弃该帧。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:513
msgid ""
"The reason is that these envelopes lose their value quickly. A preview "
"frame, a snapshot of the work in progress, is replaced by the next frame,"
" and the final result replaces all of them. A preview frame expires after"
" 60 seconds. A frame that is not delivered needs no notice to the user. "
"Previews are described in :ref:`topics-preview`, and the extended Agent "
"Card in :ref:`topics-capabilities`."
msgstr ""
"原因在于这些信封的价值很快消失。预览帧是进行中工作的快照，会被下一帧取代，最终结果又取代所有预览帧。预览帧在 60 "
"秒后过期。未送达的帧无需通知用户。预览见 :ref:`topics-preview`，扩展 Agent 卡片见 :ref:`topics-"
"capabilities`\\ 。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:520
msgid ""
"An identity whose gate is closed (see :ref:`topics-identity-states`) "
"hands out no one-shot envelope either."
msgstr "闸门关闭的身份（参见 :ref:`topics-identity-states`）同样不会交出任何一次性信封。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:524
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:526
msgid ""
"The first contact to an unknown recipient needs a fresh key confirmation "
"from the recipient's hub. If that hub cannot be reached, the message "
"waits in the outbox."
msgstr "向未知收件方的首次联系，需要收件方 Hub 提供新的密钥确认。如果无法连接该 Hub，消息在发件箱中等待。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:529
msgid ""
"Message identifiers are held to the content they were sent with. Reusing "
"a ``messageId`` with different content on an open task is refused with "
"``message_id_reused``, and nothing is sent."
msgstr ""
"消息标识与其发送时的内容绑定。在进行中的任务上以不同内容重用 ``messageId`` 会被拒绝，返回 "
"``message_id_reused``，且不发送任何内容。"

#: ../../topics/messaging.rst:532
msgid ""
"Direct connections between nodes (the ``p2p`` module) are optional and "
"carry the same envelopes. They are used only between peers on the allow "
"or trust lists, who then learn each other's network address. The "
"connection is not encrypted by itself; the envelopes are."
msgstr ""
"节点之间的直接连接（``p2p`` 模块）是可选的，传输同样的信封。仅在 allow 或 trust "
"名单中的对端之间使用，双方由此得知彼此的网络地址。连接本身不加密，加密的是信封。"

